        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana OK6045B, 6\" x 4-1/2\" Olive Knuckle Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana Olive Knuckle Hinge is a Paumelle hinge where the knuckles have an olive shape. It is best suited for light-weight doors such as kitchen cabinet doors or bathroom vanity doors. This solid brass hinge measures 6 inches high and 4-1/2 inches wide. Founded in 1977, Deltana is the architectural hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OK6045B-specifications.jpg?v=1704354598\" width=\"527\" height=\"316\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana OK6045B Specifications\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana OK6045B 6  x 4-1/2 Olive Knuckle Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Wing Width: 7/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Overall Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Barrel Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Leaf Thickness: 7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n<Li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screw: #12x1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-OK6045B-specifications.pdf?v=1704262254\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana OK6045B Hinge Specification (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this olive knuckle hinge: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Olive Knuckle Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Olive Knuckle Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-olive-kunckle-handing.gif?v=1704354537\"  width=\"411\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
