                "title": "6 Inch x 4-1/2 Inch Olive Knuckle Hinge, Deltana OK6045B",
                "description": "Deltana OK6045B 6 x 4-1/2 inch Olive Knuckle Hinge - The 6 inch solid brass Olive Knuckle Hinge is a full mortise, extruded hinge. It is made by Deltana, a leader in quality architectural hardware. Available in 10 finishes, this cabinet door hinge uses a #12x1-1/4 inch wood screw.",
